    party;
  - reuse the Call Indigo brand assets — the name, wordmark, logo marks, colour
    system, or the photography created for the business;
  - present this work, or a derivative of it, as original work of another party.


Third-party material
--------------------

This repository contains material owned by others and redistributed under their own
terms. Nothing in this notice restricts rights you hold under those terms, and nothing
in those terms grants you rights to the Call Indigo work.

The register — component, source, licence, and the obligations each imposes — is
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md.

Two entries there need particular attention:

  1. The marketing design derives from a COMMERCIAL ThemeForest template (Valvoro,
     item 62644376). The template's own source and image library are present in this
     repository, and the licence covering them is held by the client. It does not
     permit redistribution.

  2. Two bundled MIT files have had their licence notices stripped and are pending
     restoration.


